## Why This Is Asked
This question probes end-to-end latency, multi-region replication, data isolation, idempotency, observability, and cost.

## Key Concepts
- IoT Hub, Event Hubs, Durable Functions
- Cosmos DB per-tenant partitioning and access control
- Cross-region replication, private endpoints, auditing
- Disaster recovery and cost optimization

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo: deduplicate by messageId in Durable Function
async function process(event) {
  const key = event.messageId;
  if (await storage.exists(key)) return;
  await storage.put(key, true);
  // further processing
}
```

