- Cosmos DB partitioning per tenant
- Key Vault customer-managed keys
- Immutable audit logs (Blob; WORM)
- Idempotence and exactly-once-like semantics
- OpenTelemetry tracing and tenant RBAC
- Data deletion subject requests

